At this time, the device has been implanted for >2 years with good recording viability (Supplementary Note
1
) and continues to be used for research purposes.

With these parameters, the system was activated as intended (true positive) in 13 out of 14 research task repetitions acquired during research sessions (Research Session Data; Table
1
) and no false positives were present in the Initial Night Measurements.

More than 90% of electrodes on each 64-electrode array could reliably detect spiking activity at 2 Hz or higher throughout more than 19 months after implant (Fig.
4a
).
